# Angular

- Standalone components and `app.config.ts` patterns used in repo.
- Auth: OIDC via existing `auth.service` / `oidc.config`; do not embed client secrets in SPA.
- i18n: update `public/assets/i18n/en.json` and `ta.json` together when adding user-visible strings.
- Proxy dev API via `proxy.conf.json`; avoid hard-coded production URLs in `environment.ts`.